    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uber Destruction is packed with awesome roguelike elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just how much action are we talking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/c18a17a781ad4ac8c86a0c2f6e8b29c6.webp?t=1739845049\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/9dbc985996640f6d9cb6f8bfed8a87ba.poster.avif?t=1739845049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/9dbc985996640f6d9cb6f8bfed8a87ba.webm?t=1739845049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Find unique weapons and items from all sorts of chests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/e226e19a4a8f32452b6280c723ff2e52.poster.avif?t=1739845049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/e226e19a4a8f32452b6280c723ff2e52.webm?t=1739845049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Plenty of ways to take down your foes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/0ae3d33fdb4d513c367c1a9aad45a5a1.poster.avif?t=1739845049\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/0ae3d33fdb4d513c367c1a9aad45a5a1.apng?t=1739845049\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><strong>Earn and save your shards to purchase different upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Multiplayer &amp; local co-op mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chests and shops</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of levels</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wicked bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insane weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerful items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bumpin' soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Silly references</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And DESTRUCTION!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355200/extras/c18a17a781ad4ac8c86a0c2f6e8b29c6.webp?t=1739845049\" /></div></p>",
